     "id": "ja-a0-salut-en-g1",
     "title": "Politeness: です (desu)",
     "md": "Japanese is very polite. Sentences often end with **です** (desu): **元気です** (I'm fine). Greetings are fixed expressions: **こんにちは** (hello).",
     "examples": [
      {
       "text": "元気です",
       "tr": "I'm fine"
      }
     ]
    },
